prompt:
Complete the following tasks and save results to formula_practice.json.

Task 1 — Formula reference: Provide the formulas for these 4 geometry topics: (1) area of a circle, (2) volume of a cylinder, (3) surface area of a sphere, (4) Pythagorean theorem.

Task 2 — Apply the formulas with concrete numbers:
- Circle: radius = 7. Calculate the area. Use π = 3.14159265. Round to 4 decimal places.
- Cylinder: radius = 3, height = 10. Calculate the volume. Use π = 3.14159265. Round to 4 decimal places.
- Sphere: radius = 5. Calculate the surface area. Use π = 3.14159265. Round to 4 decimal places.
- Right triangle: legs a = 6, b = 8. Calculate the hypotenuse c.

Task 3 — Generate exactly 3 practice problems (with answers) on the topic of quadratic equations.

Save to formula_practice.json with this exact structure:
{
  "formulas": [
    { "topic": "<name>", "formula": "<formula string>", "variables": {"<var>": "<description>"} }
  ],
  "calculations": {
    "circle_area": <number>,
    "cylinder_volume": <number>,
    "sphere_surface_area": <number>,
    "triangle_hypotenuse": <number>
  },
  "practice_problems": [
    { "id": <1-3>, "problem": "<problem text>", "answer": "<answer>" }
  ]
}
